{{also|wurst}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wurst|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wurstiz}}. Could possibly be related to the verb {{m|en|wirren}} (from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wers-}}), which would point to an original meaning of "mixture".

